      "BECCA: You have nothing to say?\nIZZY: Thank you?\nBECCA: You were in a bar-fight.\nIZZY: It wasn’t a bar-fight.",
      "BECCA: Yeah, good. Hanging in there.\nGABBY: You sure?",
      "GABBY: That can be hard, I remember when my cousin got pregnant--\nBECCA: Yeah, it's not really a big deal.\nGABBY: Okay. If you wanna talk about it though, you know the group’s right here.\nBECCA: Yeah, I don't think so. \"Hey everybody, fresh meat.\"",
      "GABBY: Well it doesn’t really matter when she was here, my point is that she reminds me of Lydia. She really wasn’t into the support group model at…\nBECCA: How long have you been in Group?",
      "BECCA: Hi, I'm here to see Scott Bader in the Events Department.\nRECEPTIONIST: I don't have a Bader listed.\nBECCA: Oh. Well that’s weird.\nBECCA: Kate Finn. What about Kate?"
    ]
